   3.461321764742494*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0455b9c6-396c-4309-b475-\
cca4d53283ab"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "S\[ADoubleDot]g att vi vill l\[ODoubleDot]sa ekvationen ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"p", "(", "x", ")"}], " ", "=", " ", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"1cba6cad-e7f2-412c-a838-55a63d7d1951"],
 ". Vi kan d\[ARing] anv\[ADoubleDot]nda kommandot ",
 ButtonBox["Solve",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Solve"],
 ". Notera det dubbla likhetstecknet. Eftersom det enkla likhetstecknet \
\[ADoubleDot]r upptaget f\[ODoubleDot]r att tilldela varibler \
v\[ADoubleDot]rden, anv\[ADoubleDot]nds ett ",
 StyleBox["dubbelt likhetstecken",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " f\[ODoubleDot]r att markera logisk likhet. Notera ocks\[ARing] att vi m\
\[ARing]ste tala om att det \[ADoubleDot]r variabeln ",
 StyleBox["x ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "vi vill l\[ODoubleDot]sa ut ur ekvationen."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461321392390583*^9, 3.461321462176303*^9}, {
  3.46132227678683*^9, 3.461322455105129*^9}, {3.463916640043062*^9, 
  3.463916714325748*^9}, {3.463916748777175*^9, 
  3.463916790728034*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bb93604e-fa1d-4b32-8485-\
315711045e5a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Solve", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"p", " ", "\[Equal]", " ", "0"}], ",", "x"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461321466579958*^9, 3.461321478392234*^9}, 
   3.904284652582292*^9},ExpressionUUID->"51e68d47-29d9-4716-bd67-\
3f76923cb428"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Svaret ser kanske f\[ODoubleDot]rst lite kryptiskt ut. Eftersom ekvationen \
har flera l\[ODoubleDot]sningar f\[ARing]r vi en lista med \
l\[ODoubleDot]sningar. Varje l\[ODoubleDot]sning ges i form av en ers\
\[ADoubleDot]ttningsregel. F\[ODoubleDot]ljande uttryck betyder \"ers\
\[ADoubleDot]tt ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["x", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f0ea265d-4ecd-4f13-814b-ed4ee8070e13"],
 " med 2 i uttrycket ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["p", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "55a33a01-2ccf-4076-af71-2a0bfc81f269"],
 "\". Eftersom 2 \[ADoubleDot]r en l\[ODoubleDot]sning til ovanst\[ARing]ende \
ekvation, f\[ARing]r vi svaret 0. Pilsymbolen,",
 StyleBox[" ->", "Input"],
 " , skrivs genom ett minustecken f\[ODoubleDot]ljt av st\[ODoubleDot]rre-\
\[ADoubleDot]n symbolen."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461321519475931*^9, 3.461321659808338*^9}, {
  3.4613216909961*^9, 3.461321694590282*^9}, {3.461321776179605*^9, 
  3.461321804972506*^9}, {3.461321853101491*^9, 3.461321928821182*^9}, {
  3.46132535051211*^9, 3.461325352402087*^9}, {3.9042846753155327`*^9, 
  3.904284723114113*^9}, {3.905567411975213*^9, 
  3.9055674122487793`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"340e4dbc-7dec-401c-aa8e-\
6309820b9c7b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"p", " ", "/.", " ", 
  RowBox[{"x", "->", "2"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461318895536464*^9, 3.461318914934529*^9}, {
  3.461318953210954*^9, 3.461318961329349*^9}, {3.461321811205061*^9, 
  3.461321823209729*^9}, {3.904285586988037*^9, 
  3.904285587415326*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b8b50d2c-0630-4195-ab0a-\
0a7d6a52aeab"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "N\[ADoubleDot]r vi \[ADoubleDot]r f\[ADoubleDot]rdiga med att anv\
\[ADoubleDot]nda en symbol \[ADoubleDot]r det en god id\[EAcute] att frig\
\[ODoubleDot]ra den f\[ODoubleDot]r andra \[ADoubleDot]ndam\[ARing]l. Detta g\
\[ODoubleDot]rs med kommandot ",
 ButtonBox["Clear",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Clear"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461321955850219*^9, 
  3.46132203160688*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1cc8f12b-db2f-4e27-a8e0-\
